          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Balaki yaakoba Balaamu ati: “Idha tuje mu kifo ekindi gh'onaabonera abandi ku Baisiraeli abanaakuba okumpi, waire nga toobabone boonaboona. Memale olwo obankolimirire ng'oli eyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamutwala mu musiri gwa Zofimu ku ngulu okw'olusozi Pisiga. Yaazimba alutaari musanvu era yaagheerayo ku buli ndala ente enume n'entaama enume.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
