          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaamu yaira ye Balaki, yaamwagaana ng'akaayemereire kumpi n'ekigheebwayo kye ekyokebwa, ghalala n'abakungu aba Moabu. Balaki yaamubuuza ati: “Musengwa akobye ki?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
