            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabiri Balaki yaakoba Balaamu ati: “Mpegaano idha, ka nkutwale mu kifo ekindi, oba katyo Katonda anaikiriza okukuleka waabankolimirira eyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.27",
